WEBVTT

00:00:02.710 --> 00:00:07.520
<i>We will now begin the World High School 
Cheerleading Championships.</i>

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:12.060
<i>Our first performance will be from the 
Kaminoki High School cheerleading club.</i>

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:48.550
We did it!

00:00:58.740 --> 00:00:59.880
Kohane?!

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:03.000
Hatoya Kohane, you'll be standing 
for the rest of class.

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:04.750
A competition?

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:09.470
Yeah! The chair comp—I mean, the 
cheer competition that was on TV.

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:12.130
I recorded it, and after watching it, 
I actually dreamed about it.

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:14.190
They have competitions?

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.820
You were in it with me, Uki!

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:16.630
In your dream, right?

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:20.250
Your costume was so cute!

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:21.220
Wha—

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.500
You should do cheer with me!

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:25.980
I told you, I won't do it!

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:38.990
<b>Anima Yell!</b>

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:03.990
Kohane! So this is where you were.

00:03:04.610 --> 00:03:05.960
Uki!

00:03:07.240 --> 00:03:10.480
<i>My childhood friend, Hatoya Kohane,</i>

00:03:10.480 --> 00:03:12.410
<i>often gets hurt.</i>

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:16.590
Jeez, you got hurt again?

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:19.270
We're gonna be in high school 
next year, you know.

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:20.130
Owie...

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.280
What happened today?

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:24.470
Well...

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.690
<i>Usually, the reason she gets hurt is 
because she was helping someone.</i>

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:30.750
<i>When she sees someone in trouble,</i>

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:33.610
<i>she takes off running without 
even thinking about herself.</i>

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:38.560
Apparently the ball was really important 
to her, so she was really happy.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:39.650
That makes me happy!

00:03:40.120 --> 00:03:42.840
That doesn't make me happy.

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:46.590
I mean... you're hurt, Kohane.

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:49.620
I'll be fine! It's not as bad as it looks.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.870
That's not the point!

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:54.250
I don't want you getting hurt at all!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:56.300
Okay, I'll be more careful!

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:59.000
<i>She totally doesn't get it!</i>

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:02.880
<i>As soon as someone else needs help,</i>

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:06.940
<i>she's going to forget everything I just 
said and take off running again.</i>

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:13.200
<i>That's why, when Kohane told me that 
she found something she wanted to do,</i>

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:14.650
<i>it made me happy.</i>

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:19.150
<i>Hopefully, she'll put herself 
first once in a while now,</i>

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:22.280
<i>and act calm like high 
school students should.</i>

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.520
Kohane?

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:29.290
What's up? Why'd you call me up here?

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.510
Behold!

00:04:37.150 --> 00:04:38.920
She's not calm at all!

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:44.090
<b>Episode 2: Cute Yet Cool</b>

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:48.480
Arima-san joined, so we can 
finally begin practice!

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:50.600
You already told me that yesterday.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.720
Let me know if you need anything!

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:53.980
I'll cheer you on!

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:54.850
Yeah, sure.

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.280
Hup...

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:00.250
You can do it, you can do it, Uki!

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:01.530
You could help me here!

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.820
I'm too scared to go 
anywhere near the fence!

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.910
Then why'd you come up to the roof?!

00:05:07.510 --> 00:05:11.160
Look! I got so excited that 
I even ordered uniforms!

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:13.470
I have one for Arima-san, too!

00:05:13.470 --> 00:05:16.170
Ordered them? From where?

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.410
This really useful web page!

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:21.050
<b>I'll cheer you on at night, too</b>

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:21.050
This delicate piece 
will help enhance 
your night together.

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:21.050
I knew it'd be something like that...

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:23.870
Take that off right now and 
return it immediately!

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:25.800
Aw, but it's so cute...

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:31.680
You definitely shouldn't 
show this to Arima-san...

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.470
You think so?

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:37.100
I also thought it was a little off...

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:38.980
Oh, so you did realize—

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:41.640
Arima-san looks better 
in blue than in purple!

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:42.480
Who cares?!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.930
I'm so excited for after 
school! Wanna come, Uki?

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:46.860
No.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:50.810
You're pretty much a member of the 
cheer club. You don't need to be shy.

00:05:50.810 --> 00:05:52.810
I'm not being shy.

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:00.830
I'm so sorry! I'll order 
one for you right now!

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.380
Don't!

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.920
And stop imagining me in that!

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:11.080
Time goes by so slowly...

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:15.530
I'm surprised you're actually 
taking notes like you should be.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:22.400
Team names

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:19.530
You should find more members 
before thinking up a team name.

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:21.720
I did what I could for the time being.

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:31.400
Usually, gathering members 
would be important,

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:35.030
but today, I'd like to do some exercise.

00:06:35.030 --> 00:06:35.940
But...

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:39.640
Why are you already exhausted 
before we've even started?

00:06:39.640 --> 00:06:41.000
I'm tired mentally...

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:44.380
But I have plenty of energy to cheer!

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:46.320
What are we going to do today?

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:48.130
We're going to test your physical strength.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:55.500
It's essential to determine 
everyone's individual abilities.

00:06:55.500 --> 00:06:58.220
It'll help with deciding their positions.

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:57.200
Here.

00:06:59.160 --> 00:07:01.150
Sorry, I couldn't help myself.

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:03.800
Concentration: zero.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:05.520
That's part of the test?

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:08.820
First, we need to do warm-ups.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.350
You got it, Sensei!

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:16.830
<i>I'm going to get yelled at!</i>

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:19.290
It's okay.

00:07:20.240 --> 00:07:22.590
I wasn't expecting anything, anyway.

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:25.560
That hurts even mo— ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:07:25.560 --> 00:07:28.200
No one can do it right from the start.

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:34.880
And your flexibility isn't going 
to suddenly change overnight.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:37.360
We just need to work at it gradually.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:40.860
<i>So she's planning on sticking 
with me for the long haul...</i>

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:42.190
Yeah!

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:45.830
That being said, I'm not 
going to go easy on you.

00:07:48.390 --> 00:07:52.950
<i>Okay! I'm going to do my best! 
Just you watch, Arima-san!</i>

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:02.080
10.2 seconds.

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:06.840
<i>I must be a woman... better suited 
for long-distance running...</i>

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:08.490
Now let's try long-distance.

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:12.040
<i>No, I must be a woman made for jumping...</i>

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.280
Vertical jumps.

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:17.840
Jumping from side to side.

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:22.300
<i>I-I'm a woman made... for jumping... 
from side to side...</i>

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:26.540
Am I even a woman?

00:08:26.540 --> 00:08:29.190
Huh?! Um, I believe so...

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.810
I know! I'm a woman made to cheer!

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:34.750
And what do you mean by that?

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:37.320
I'm plenty confident when it 
comes to cheering people on!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.300
<i>Well, she has a point...</i>

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:46.830
Long-distance running
Vertical jumping
Jumping side to side
Smile

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:45.780
<i>I won't tell her this, but...</i>

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:50.550
But that was more like just 
jumping down than cheering.

00:08:50.550 --> 00:08:53.550
By the way, have you gotten 
used to high places?

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:54.800
N-Nope...

00:08:55.150 --> 00:08:59.560
I was only able to jump that one time 
because my cheer power was maxed out...

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:02.760
Cheer... power?

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:04.940
Yup. Cheer power!

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:08.260
I see!

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.190
<b>Satisfied.</b>

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:16.060
That does it for the 
physical strength tests.

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:23.900
<i>I guess I can't blame her for being 
depressed by these horrible results.</i>

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:25.340
We...

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.240
We didn't do anything 
cheerleader-like at all!

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.460
That's what's bugging you?!

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:33.580
Well, I was looking forward to it!

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:35.850
Dances using pom poms,

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:38.360
and maybe even some stunts!

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:40.100
All that in your first practice?

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:44.230
We need to figure out what your 
individual abilities are first.

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:56.440
Hatoya-san, here you go.

00:09:57.890 --> 00:09:59.110
What's this?

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:02.620
It's my practice outfit from middle school,

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:06.120
but it's too small for me now, 
so you can have it, if you'd like.

00:10:06.440 --> 00:10:08.700
A p-practice outfit for cheerleading?

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:09.880
<i>She got over that fast!</i>

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:14.920
Wow, it's so cute! And not only that...

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:18.620
This amazing design even allows 
me to cheer with my butt!

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:20.800
I don't think that was the 
designer's intention!

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:23.550
Do you feel more like a cheerleader now?

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:26.330
I'm so happy! Thank you, Arima-san!

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:27.340
N-No problem...

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:28.310
Oh, yeah!

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:31.310
I got this for you, Arima-san!

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:35.370
Are you mocking cheer?!

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:38.500
No, I'm not! I love it!

00:10:40.570 --> 00:10:43.580
<b>One Week Later</b>

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:49.260
My whole body is sore 
after training all week...

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:50.460
Let me hold your backpack.

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:51.710
Thanks...

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:55.240
<i>I guess that's what you'd expect 
from a former top cheerleader.</i>

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:57.210
<i>It must be really rigorous training.</i>

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:59.960
I have to touch my toes 
ten times, do ten sit-ups,

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:02.890
then ten push-ups, and ten sprints!

00:11:02.890 --> 00:11:04.570
It's so rough!

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:07.980
Uki?!

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:10.890
I thought I'd help you out 
with your training a bit.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.900
I wanna do actual cheerleading!

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:19.130
But the things you're doing now 
are basics for cheer, right?

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:21.630
The basics are important for anything.

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:23.280
I know that, but...

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:31.540
It looks like Kohane's getting 
tired from all the basic training.

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:33.670
<i>And I'm spoiling her again.</i>

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.810
But I haven't had her do 
anything strenuous yet.

00:11:36.810 --> 00:11:38.050
You're absolutely right!

00:11:38.610 --> 00:11:42.550
It might be because she's never 
been great at physical activities.

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:44.940
I think if you can raise her motivation,

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:46.800
she'll feel more willing to do the basics.

00:11:46.800 --> 00:11:48.790
But that's just spoiling—

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:50.810
<b>Only training</b>

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:51.810
<b>Motivation declines          Only training</b>

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:52.810
<b>Desire to cheer declines      Motivation declines</b>

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:53.810
<b>She quits cheerleading     Desire to cheer declines</b>

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:55.060
<b>I'm alone again      She quits cheerleading</b>

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:55.690
My bad!

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:56.610
<b>I'm alone again</b>

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:58.320
<b>I'm 
Alone 
Again</b>

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:01.760
Alone... alone... All alone...

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:03.100
Alone...

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:04.940
<i>Wait, why'd her trauma switch flip on?</i>

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:05.610
Alone... Alone...

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:09.230
So today, there's been a 
slight change in plans.

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:11.330
We'll do something that 
feels more like cheerleading.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:14.360
You'll be joining us, Sawatari-san, 
since you're the one who suggested this.

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:15.330
Why?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.090
Let's make some pom poms today.

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:21.930
Aren't pom poms great? 
They're so cheer-like and cute!

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:24.790
<i>Thank goodness. She seems to feel better.</i>

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:29.150
First, we'll wrap this ribbon 
around this cardboard.

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:33.020
While we do that, we're going 
to spread our legs like this

00:12:33.510 --> 00:12:35.300
and stretch our Achilles tendons.

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:39.020
Once you wrap it about twenty times, 
carefully slip the ribbon off,

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:41.530
and we'll then tie the middle.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:43.840
As you do that, keep 
your legs stretched open.

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:46.450
<i>You're gradually sneaking 
in some training...</i>

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:50.450
Dang, this is harder than it looks.

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:53.940
Yeah, my body seems to be trembling...

00:12:54.840 --> 00:12:57.210
I'll tell you the trick, Sawatari-san.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.960
There's a trick to this?

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:00.570
The truth is...

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:02.960
There's no need to stretch your 
Achilles tendon while doing this.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:04.240
Yeah, I knew that.

00:13:04.240 --> 00:13:05.340
My stars!

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:09.980
We did it.

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:12.680
Look! They're super cute 
when you open them up!

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:14.640
Look, look!

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.640
Stop that!

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:15.870
It's so cute!

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:18.400
Next, without opening them, 
we'll be cutting both ends.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.400
Stop that!

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:25.380
Once you do that, spread 
them out from the center.

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.360
And while you do that...

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.450
<i>She's thinking hard...</i>

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:31.320
You'll be cheering!

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:34.700
Go for win! Go for win! Go for win!

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:34.700
<i>You're definitely pushing it, Arima-san...</i>

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:38.580
Go for whoa! Go for whoa!

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:38.580
<i>What? She didn't even hesitate!</i>

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:43.070
Tie two pieces together on 
the inside, and they're finished.

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:46.460
Wow, I'm sort of impressed.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.430
Wait, what?!

00:13:48.860 --> 00:13:51.440
They looked the same for most 
of the process! How did you...

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:55.510
I ended up concentrating too much on 
the cheers, and before I realized it...

00:13:57.240 --> 00:13:59.560
The first pom poms I've ever made...

00:13:59.560 --> 00:14:01.790
But you've made some before.

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.530
I made those my own way, though.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.700
Very well. Why don't we trade?

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.440
<i>Arima-san feels bad...</i>

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:11.640
<i>But this is... This is...</i>

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:13.790
Y-You can trade for mine!

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:15.930
Why don't we all trade, then?

00:14:15.930 --> 00:14:16.960
Sounds good!

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:21.960
<i>Kohane's... first pom poms...</i>

00:14:22.820 --> 00:14:25.460
Pom poms that we as the 
cheer club made together...

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.740
This'll be a great memory!

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:28.470
Yes.

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.310
Hey! Don't bring me into this!

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:33.890
Tch.

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:44.790
<i>I can't believe I got dragged into that.</i>

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.680
Y-You've got the wrong idea!

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:03.580
I was just testing out the 
pom poms Kohane made!

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:06.490
I'm not joining! I'm not 
going to be a cheerleader!

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:11.590
Morning!

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:14.170
Oh, good morning, Sawatari-san.

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:16.270
Hey, did you decide on a club yet?

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.360
No, not yet.

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:19.050
We haven't, either.

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:21.790
Yeah, we need to decide soon.

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:24.160
Is there a club you're 
interested in, Sawatari-san?

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:25.050
I'm not...

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:25.940
In that case!

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:29.190
Huh? It won't open...

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:34.980
Uki! Uki! Uki!

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:34.860
Yeah, I can't think of a single 
club I'm interested in.

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:36.580
Uki!

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:40.220
Giving those who are lost a 
nudge in the right direction

00:15:40.220 --> 00:15:42.010
is also a part of cheer!

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:43.520
Come on over to the cheerleading club!

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:46.280
By "give them a nudge," you actually 
mean "push them over."

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:47.980
What were you even doing in the locker?

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:50.970
I thought I'd surprise you guys and tell 
you how great the cheerleading club is!

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:54.680
Okay, then tell us what's so great about it, 
since you're now an authority on cheer.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:59.160
<i>Authority on cheer... Authority 
on cheer... Authority on cheer...</i>

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.980
<i>An authority on cheer...</i>

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:04.480
Okay, everyone, to your seats.

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.030
And time's up.

00:16:06.030 --> 00:16:07.680
Well, bye.

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:09.800
Good luck with your cheerleading club. Bye.

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:12.360
I'll cheer you on if you ever need me!

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:15.370
