Factorization formula (review)</b>

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:15.370
When doing factorization 
on complex formulas...

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:18.060
From Hatoya-san.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:26.250
The Top 10 Things About Cheer
1. You can help people out
2. You can have a lot of fun with everyone
3. You'll end up with a great smile
4. You'll be good at sports 
5. The uniforms are cute
6. Cute yet cool
7. Cute!
8. Amazing! 
9. Beautiful!!
10. Yay!!!

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:26.250
<i>What the hell is this?</i>

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:29.150
<i>And she ran out of ideas toward the end...</i>

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:30.620
Uki!

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:34.140
What was with that half-baked ranking?

00:16:34.140 --> 00:16:35.510
It's not half-baked!

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:39.050
I mean, cheer is cute! It's amazing!

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:40.760
It's beautiful!

00:16:44.210 --> 00:16:46.010
And, like, totally yay!

00:16:46.010 --> 00:16:47.520
You're just trying to force it!

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:50.810
Don't you feel any different 
after reading that letter?

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:52.780
I'm definitely at a loss for words.

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:55.100
Cheerleading will bring you 
good things, you know!

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:56.610
For example?

00:16:57.020 --> 00:16:59.030
Your body becomes more flexible!

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.820
See? Isn't this amazing?

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:04.000
<i>Is she joking or serious?</i>

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:06.970
I'm way more flexible than before!

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:10.630
With that? I mean, I like exercising, but...

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:18.730
I wonder if punishing uniform 
thieves counts as exercising...

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:20.390
H-Huh?

00:17:23.460 --> 00:17:24.860
Let's ea—

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:28.280
Aren't the mini pom poms cute?

00:17:28.280 --> 00:17:31.740
Oh, come on, Kohane. 
You even put them in there?

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:33.270
So, where's my lunch?

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:36.950
Peep!

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:40.480
I'm having a really hard time convincing Uki...

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:43.340
It might be difficult to 
imagine herself doing it

00:17:43.340 --> 00:17:45.210
if she doesn't see the real thing.

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:49.820
<i>Come to think of it, I didn't 
decide I wanted to do cheer</i>

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:51.670
<i>until I saw the real thing.</i>

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:55.660
I'll figure out a way for her to 
see some actual cheerleading.

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:59.150
Rather than devising some 
scheme to get her to join,

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:02.630
try to express your honest feelings about 
how much you want to do this with her.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:08.040
I mean, that's all you can really do.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:09.060
That's it?!

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:12.710
<i>I'll tell you, Uki! I'll tell you how I feel!</i>

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:17.850
<i>Um... I want to do cheer with Uki,</i>

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:20.160
<i>and I want her to enjoy it...</i>

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:23.600
<i>I know that she'll like 
the uniforms, too...</i>

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:24.680
Kohane.

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:26.910
Where have you been?

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:28.500
Uki!

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:33.210
<i>Um... Um...</i>

00:18:33.890 --> 00:18:35.130
Uki, I...

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:37.730
I want to do it with you, Uki!

00:18:37.730 --> 00:18:40.640
Huh?! Buh... wha... What the 
hell are you talking about?!

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:45.010
Oh, you meant cheer...

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:48.730
Did you already promise someone 
else you'd join their club?

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:50.960
O-Of course not.

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:53.020
It's not like I have anyone...

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:55.560
other than you, to make that promise to...

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:56.900
Sawatari-san!

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:59.530
This is from Arima-san in Class 1.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:02.780
<b>Sawatari-sama</b>

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:02.020
She asked me to give this to you.

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:06.620
I guess you got close enough to write each 
other notes before I even noticed.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:10.120
How can you say that when this clearly 
looks like she's challenging me?

00:19:11.430 --> 00:19:15.580
"Please meet me on the roof." 
Is she really challenging me?

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:18.630
Honestly, now even Arima-san's 
getting ridiculous...

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:22.560
Why'd you shut it?

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:25.600
W-W-W-Well, Arima-san was striking a pose!

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.480
She's waiting for you!

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.210
That's enough talk!

00:19:29.210 --> 00:19:30.840
It's starting! Hurry!

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:32.300
Start? What's starting?

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:34.650
I'm sure it'll be great! Just open the door!

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:41.320
Go, go, Kaminoki! Let's go, 
Kaminoki! Go, fight, win!

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:46.950
Go, go, Kaminoki! Let's go, 
Kaminoki! Go, fight, win!

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:00.920
Let's go!

00:20:21.070 --> 00:20:22.700
That's amazing!

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.680
Right? Right?! It's amazing, right?

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:26.160
Don't you feel like doing it now?

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:28.540
Uh... Well...

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:32.540
I'm still not sure if I want to do it, 
but I know one thing now...

00:20:36.350 --> 00:20:38.200
It's cute but cool!

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:40.210
I know, right?!

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:45.020
I would also love to have you 
as a teammate, Sawatari-san.

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:48.730
I know why Kohane wants me to join, 
but why do you say that, Arima-san?

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.730
When supporting, the more 
people we have, the better.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.950
When we're supporting Hatoya-san, that is!

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:57.880
Oh, are we talking about stunts?!

00:20:57.880 --> 00:20:59.860
<i>She's definitely talking 
about mental support.</i>

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:10.380
I guess helping a friend do something 
they want to do is also like cheerleading...

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:14.220
Okay, I'll join the cheerleading club—

00:21:14.220 --> 00:21:15.890
Uki!

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:17.600
Or not!

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:18.710
Sorry!

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:22.200
Let's introduce ourselves 
formally. I'm Arima Hizume.

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:25.300
Oh, I'm Sawatari Uki. 
Pleasure to work with you.

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:28.590
I have absolutely no experience 
in cheer. Will that be okay?

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:29.800
Of course.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:33.900
Please do your best to support Hatoya-san.

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:36.400
Sure. I'll do my absolute best.

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:39.310
<i>Wait... But I'm the cheer authority...</i>

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:44.040
But why were you so hesitant to 
join the cheerleading club, Uki?

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:49.130
W-Well... The cheer uniform 
skirts are so short...

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:51.610
But you like cute clothes, don't you?

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:53.830
I-I-I do not!

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:57.710
Then would you prefer the uniform with pants?

00:21:57.710 --> 00:21:59.180
They do exist.

00:21:59.180 --> 00:22:02.590
Hey! Those look like the 
practice clothes you gave me!

00:22:05.430 --> 00:22:06.410
Push.

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:42.020
Next time: "The Cheer Association, 
Cheering for Love!"
